§ `Part 1 -- Preliminary provisions`

§§ `1. Title, 2. Commencement`

`the short title of this Act` MEANS "Online Safety (Minimum Age and Child Safety Risk Assessment) Act 2026"

-- cl 2: this Act comes into force 6 months after Royal assent.
`months after Royal assent before commencement` MEANS 6

§§ `5. Meaning of age-restricted platform`

-- cl 5(2): specified feature, in relation to an internet service, means a
-- feature that recommends content based on the user, generates a continuously
-- updated stream, displays engagement information about user content, enables
-- time-limited engagement, or is specified in regulations.

GIVEN s IS A `internet service`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the service has 1 or more specified features` IF
        s's `recommends digital content to a user based on information about that user`
    OR  s's `generates a continuously updated stream of digital content`
    OR  s's `displays information about how others have viewed or engaged with user content`
    OR  s's `enables a user to view or engage with digital content for a limited period`
    OR  s's `has a feature specified as a specified feature in regulations under section 62`

-- cl 5(2): excluded service means an internet service that solely or primarily
-- enables a user to do any of eight listed activities, regardless of whether it
-- meets the criteria in cl 5(1)(a)(ii) and (iii).

GIVEN s IS A `internet service`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the service is an excluded service` IF
        s's `solely or primarily enables person-to-person messages, email, voice or video calls`
    OR  s's `solely or primarily enables video gaming`
    OR  s's `solely or primarily enables access to music or podcasts on demand`
    OR  s's `solely or primarily enables access to reviews, technical support, or advice`
    OR  s's `solely or primarily enables professional networking or development`
    OR  s's `solely or primarily enables access to or engagement in education services`
    OR  s's `solely or primarily enables access to or engagement in healthcare services`
    OR  s's `solely or primarily enables an activity specified in regulations under section 62`

-- cl 5(1)(a): the four-limb conjunctive test, including the excluded-service carve-out.

GIVEN s IS A `internet service`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(a)` IF
        s's `is accessible by a person who is in New Zealand`
    AND s's `enables the exchange of digital content between 2 or more users`
    AND `the service has 1 or more specified features` s
    AND NOT `the service is an excluded service` s

-- cl 5(1)(b): the AI companion limb. Note that it carries NO excluded-service
-- carve-out and requires no specified feature -- see NOTES.md, open question 1.

GIVEN s IS A `internet service`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(b)` IF
        s's `is accessible by a person who is in New Zealand`
    AND s's `displays or otherwise makes available digital content`
    AND s's `uses artificial intelligence solely or primarily to simulate a personal connection`

-- cl 5(1)(c): the regulation-making limb.

GIVEN s IS A `internet service`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(c)` IF
    s's `is specified as an age-restricted platform in regulations under section 62`

@ref Online Safety (Minimum Age and Child Safety Risk Assessment) Bill (NZ) cl 5
@export Decide whether an internet service is an age-restricted platform within the meaning of clause 5
GIVEN s IS A `internet service` @desc The clause 5 facts for the service: New Zealand accessibility, exchange between users, which specified features it has, which excluded-service activity it solely or primarily enables, whether it is an AI companion service, and whether regulations name it.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the service is an age-restricted platform` IF
        `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(a)` s
    OR  `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(b)` s
    OR  `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(c)` s

§§ `Scenario fixtures`

-- An ordinary social platform: caught by limb (a).
`a social feed platform` MEANS `internet service` WITH
    name                                                                                IS "SocialFeed"
    `is accessible by a person who is in New Zealand`                                    IS TRUE
    `enables the exchange of digital content between 2 or more users`                    IS TRUE
    `recommends digital content to a user based on information about that user`          IS TRUE
    `generates a continuously updated stream of digital content`                         IS TRUE
    `displays information about how others have viewed or engaged with user content`     IS TRUE
    `enables a user to view or engage with digital content for a limited period`         IS FALSE
    `has a feature specified as a specified feature in regulations under section 62`     IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables person-to-person messages, email, voice or video calls` IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables video gaming`                                           IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables access to music or podcasts on demand`                  IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables access to reviews, technical support, or advice`        IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables professional networking or development`                 IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables access to or engagement in education services`          IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables access to or engagement in healthcare services`         IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables an activity specified in regulations under section 62`  IS FALSE
    `displays or otherwise makes available digital content`                              IS TRUE
    `uses artificial intelligence solely or primarily to simulate a personal connection` IS FALSE
    `is specified as an age-restricted platform in regulations under section 62`         IS FALSE

-- A therapy chatbot: solely or primarily a healthcare service, so excluded from
-- limb (a) -- but it is an AI companion, and limb (b) has no carve-out.
`a therapy chatbot` MEANS `internet service` WITH
    name                                                                                IS "TherapyBot"
    `is accessible by a person who is in New Zealand`                                    IS TRUE
    `enables the exchange of digital content between 2 or more users`                    IS FALSE
    `recommends digital content to a user based on information about that user`          IS TRUE
    `generates a continuously updated stream of digital content`                         IS FALSE
    `displays information about how others have viewed or engaged with user content`     IS FALSE
    `enables a user to view or engage with digital content for a limited period`         IS FALSE
    `has a feature specified as a specified feature in regulations under section 62`     IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables person-to-person messages, email, voice or video calls` IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables video gaming`                                           IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables access to music or podcasts on demand`                  IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables access to reviews, technical support, or advice`        IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables professional networking or development`                 IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables access to or engagement in education services`          IS FALSE
    `solely or primarily enables access to or engagement in healthcare services`         IS TRUE
    `solely or primarily enables an activity specified in regulations under section 62`  IS FALSE
    `displays or otherwise makes available digital content`                              IS TRUE
    `uses artificial intelligence solely or primarily to simulate a personal connection` IS TRUE
    `is specified as an age-restricted platform in regulations under section 62`         IS FALSE

§§ `Machine-evaluated cases`

#EVAL `the service is an age-restricted platform` `a social feed platform`
#ASSERT `the service is an age-restricted platform` `a social feed platform` EQUALS TRUE

-- LQA probe 1: the excluded-service carve-out in cl 5(2) is attached only to
-- limb (a). A healthcare service that is also an AI companion therefore falls
-- OUT of limb (a) and straight back IN under limb (b).
#EVAL `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(a)` `a therapy chatbot`
#EVAL `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(b)` `a therapy chatbot`
#ASSERT `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(a)` `a therapy chatbot` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the service is an age-restricted platform under section 5(1)(b)` `a therapy chatbot` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the service is an age-restricted platform` `a therapy chatbot` EQUALS TRUE
